# Orchestrator runtime data — bind-mounted into the orchestrator container.
# The orchestrator passes its in-container /workspaces path through the Docker
# socket as a bind-mount source, which the daemon interprets as a host path,
# so the in-container path must equal the host path. See docker-compose.yml.
